                            " netrwPlugin.vim: Handles file transfer and remote directory listing across a network
                            "            PLUGIN SECTION
                            " Date:		Feb 09, 2021
                            " Maintainer:	Charles E Campbell <NcampObell@SdrPchip.AorgM-NOSPAM>
                            " GetLatestVimScripts: 1075 1 :AutoInstall: netrw.vim
